    ["假定n个Buff，m个目标，支持如下模式：\n0：（量大管饱）总共施加k*m个Buff：对m个对象中的每1个对象，从n个Buff中随机选k个不同的Buff添加，k取MaxCount参数，k不填or填0代表k=n，即给m个对象都挂全部Buff；\n1：（按序发放，最多1个）总共施加min(n,m)个Buff：n个Buff里按顺序分给m个对象，直至Buff拿空，或者对象耗尽；\n2：（随机发放，最多1个）总共施加min(n,m)个Buff：n个Buff挨个随机分给m个对象中的某一个，对象不可重复被选中（无放回的随机），直到Buff耗尽，或者对象耗尽；\n3：（按序发放，发完为止）总共施加n个Buff：n个Buff按顺序分给m个对象，轮完一圈的话从头继续，直至Buff耗尽；\n4：（随机发放，发完为止）总共施加n个Buff：n个Buff挨个随机分给m个对象中的某一个，对象可重复被选中（有放回的随机），直到Buff耗尽；\n5：（按序发放，1人1个）总共施加m个Buff：n个Buff按顺序分给m个对象，如果n个发完还不够，则从头继续发Buff，直到m个对象都加上了Buff；\n6：（随机发放无放回，1人1个）总共施加m个Buff：n个Buff无放回的随机分给m个对象，如果n个发完还不够，则从头继续随机发一轮Buff，直到m个对象都加上了Buff；\n7：（随机发放有放回，1人1个）总共施加m个Buff：n个Buff有放回的随机分给m个对象；"] = "Assuming n Buffs and m targets, the following modes are supported: \n 0: (Generous) Apply a total of k*m Buffs: For each of the m objects, randomly select k different Buffs from n Buffs to add. k takes the MaxCount parameter. If k is left blank or filled with 0, it means k=n, i.e., give all Buffs to all m objects; \n 1: (Sequential distribution, max 1) Apply a total of min(n,m) Buffs: Distribute n Buffs to m objects in order until the Buffs are exhausted or objects are exhausted; \n 2: (Random distribution, max 1) Apply a total of min(n,m) Buffs: Randomly distribute n Buffs one by one to one of the m objects. Objects cannot be selected repeatedly (random without replacement) until Buffs are exhausted or objects are exhausted; \n 3: (Sequential distribution, until exhausted) Apply a total of n Buffs: Distribute n Buffs to m objects in order. If a round is completed, start from the beginning until Buffs are exhausted; \n 4: (Random distribution, until exhausted) Apply a total of n Buffs: Randomly distribute n Buffs one by one to one of the m objects. Objects can be selected repeatedly (random with replacement) until Buffs are exhausted; \n 5: (Sequential distribution, 1 per person) Apply a total of m Buffs: Distribute n Buffs to m objects in order. If n Buffs are exhausted and it's not enough, start from the beginning until all m objects have Buffs; \n 6: (Random distribution without replacement, 1 per person) Apply a total of m Buffs: Randomly distribute n Buffs to m objects without replacement. If n Buffs are exhausted and it's not enough, start a new round of random distribution until all m objects have Buffs; \n 7: (Random distribution with replacement, 1 per person) Apply a total of m Buffs: Randomly distribute n Buffs to m objects with replacement.",
